In this Observer design pattern code, what will be printed when `subject.notifyObservers()` is called?
```java
class Subject {
    private List<Observer> observers = new ArrayList<>();
    public void attach(Observer o) { observers.add(o); }
    public void notifyObservers() { observers.forEach(o -> o.update()); }
}
class ConcreteObserver implements Observer {
    public void update() { System.out.print("Updated "); }
}
Subject s = new Subject();
s.attach(new ConcreteObserver());
s.attach(new ConcreteObserver());
s.notifyObservers();
```

